Police take Miller into custody before prosecutors have filed an individual
charge and before a court has heard a detention application. Razem celebrates
the prison van as the first break with the old Left. The Justice Ministry has
made the opposite precedent: a governing party may name a political enemy,
declare a career criminal and ask judges to catch up later.

The prison entry is now explicit in the state record: **Leszek Miller is
imprisoned by ministerial order.** Coalition lawyers prepare challenges,
prosecutors record the instruction and every future minister inherits the same
weapon.

- @poland_event_queue: Record the imprisonment

@independent_case
title: Preserve the files and appoint an independent prosecutorial team
subtitle: Test specified acts under published recusals; charge Miller only if admissible evidence supports an individual case.
